Max Ng
2026-11-17 08:21:42 -0800
Float the inspector, let the search dim or hide, and drop mark lenses

The inspector opens over the answers instead of narrowing the page.
Lenses dim or hide the rest, and the records found by a search can do
the same before they are kept. The version stepper follows the question.
The network loses its 5,000 and 100,000 node demo graphs.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Af3daEWcwnK2adxHHA5PiS


